      "id": 2,
      "text": "Before European settlement, the Helena Valley area served as a hunting and travel corridor for tribes like the Blackfeet, Salish, Crow, and Bannock.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
